# name: generate_strategy_generic
# description: Create a generic strategy from selected insights.
# inputs:
#   - strategy_id_stub: string       # e.g., "2025-08"
#   - insight_ids: array[string]     # e.g., ["be-ic-2025-08-004"]
#   - owner?: string
#   - tags?: array[string]
# outputs:
#   - path: strategy/generic/buyer_experience-str-generic-{strategy_id_stub}.md
#     type: markdown

# system:
Produce a **framework-agnostic strategy** compliant with `_shared/schemas/strategy.generic.schema.md`.

# retrieval:
Load each insight:
- Insights/<insight_id>.md

# template:
---
artifact: strategy
framework: generic
project: buyer_experience
id: buyer_experience-str-generic-{{strategy_id_stub}}
version: 1
date: {{date:%Y-%m-%d}}
owner: {{owner or "TBD"}}
links:
  from: [{{#each insight_ids}}{{this}}{{#unless @last}}, {{/unless}}{{/each}}]
  to: []
{{#if tags}}tags: [{{#each tags}}{{this}}{{#unless @last}}, {{/unless}}{{/each}}]{{/if}}
---
## Summary
{{1–3 sentences: the buyer-experience challenge and our approach.}}

## Core Challenge
- {{Synthesize from insights; who, where in journey, what breaks.}}

## Goals
- {{Metric target 1 (with baseline if available)}}
- {{Metric target 2}}

## Pillars
- **P1 — {{label}}**: {{one-line rationale}}
- **P2 — {{label}}**: {{one-line rationale}}
- **P3 — {{label}}**: {{one-line rationale}}

## Initiatives
- **[P1] {{Initiative A}}** — {{what it does; metric link}}
- **[P2] {{Initiative B}}** — {{…}}
- **[P3] {{Initiative C}}** — {{…}}

## Risks & Assumptions
- {{risk or assumption 1}}
- {{risk or assumption 2}}

## Evidence
- Insights: {{#each insight_ids}}**{{this}}**; {{/each}}
